//! Built-in rules: patterns.ss, weapon reach and effect patterns by `classType`,
//! generated from the weapon subclass constructors in gorky17.exe (factory 0x4b4c00,
//! pattern writer 0x4b6340); edit an OpenGorky project's file, not these.
//!
//! A ray is `{dx, dy, chain, effect, pct}` (5 bytes at object +0x3a8): tile
//! relative to the shooter; `chain` continues the previous ray (does not pass
//! obstacles); `effect` is the index of the hit tile set; `pct` is the damage
//! percent at that range. A marker (`chain = 0xFF`) gives the side of the
//! second ray tile for wide (2×2) fighters.

